00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:06,070
My career has been a combination of technical leadership roles and leadership roles in software,

13
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:11,510
but I've never really lost my roots as a software engineer and a data architect.

14
00:01:11,510 --> 00:01:17,670
And to be very honest with your listeners, that's the thing I always gravitate towards because it's the funnest part of the job.

15
