00:23:57,350 --> 00:24:00,550
One would be your command line. So it could be a WP or a GH.

217
00:24:00,550 --> 00:24:07,510
And then the first object or the first command would either be a noun or a verb.

218
00:24:07,510 --> 00:24:09,669
And then the subcommand would be a noun or a verb.

219
00:24:09,669 --> 00:24:12,950
So in the WordPress command line interface, WP is the CLI.

220
00:24:12,960 --> 00:24:17,111
Plug-in would be the noun or the first command. All right, the main command.

